'''Costly Might''' is a hybrid [[buff]] and [[debuff]]. As of [[version 3.14.0]], it is granted from an invulnerable [[totem]] that itself spawns from a modifier of the [[Trials of Chaos]].

The status icon of this hybrid is placed in the top row of the screen, the same row as [[charge]], buffs, [[aura]]s, [[minion]]s, [[flask]] effects, {{stl|Rage}} and etc.
